<title>GERMANY: BfG Bank says oper profit up 68.7 pct.</title>
<headline>BfG Bank says oper profit up 68.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Oper profit after provisions    159    vs 94</p>
<p>    Risk provisions		     +1     vs -25</p>
<p>    Loss from own account trading   21     vs 19</p>
<p>    Interest income		     568    vs 544</p>
<p>    Commission income		   95     vs 84</p>
<p>    Administration costs		501    vs 499</p>
<p>    Balance sheet total		 57.6   vs 56.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is BfG Bank AG.</p>
</text>
